    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald Sherry are delighted to bring 25 Steeplechase Court to the market which is a spacious two-bedroom, first-floor apartment extending to approximately 75sqm. Offering generous accommodation throughout, the property presents an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, downsizers, investors or those seeking a well-connected home.\n \nThe accommodation is centred around a particularly impressive open-plan kitchen, dining and sitting room, creating a bright and versatile space for both everyday living and entertaining. There are two spacious double bedrooms, with the principal bedroom benefiting from a private en-suite, together with a main bathroom.\n \nThe apartment also features two built-in wardrobes, a useful separate hot press and entrance area. \n\nPresented with a BER rating of B, the property combines generous proportions with good energy efficiency. Steeplechase Court is set within established communal grounds, providing a pleasant residential setting.\n\nLocation \nSteeplechase Court is ideally situated in Ratoath, one of County Meath's most established and popular commuter towns. The property enjoys the convenience of being within easy reach of the village's range of shops, cafés, restaurants, schools, sporting facilities and everyday amenities.\n\nRatoath occupies an excellent position between the M2 and M3 motorways, providing convenient access towards Dublin, Ashbourne and the wider Meath area. The M3 is approximately 6km from Ratoath, while the M2 is approximately 8km away.\n\nThe town is also well served by public transport. Current services include Bus Éireann routes 103, 105, 105X and 109A, providing connections towards Dublin and surrounding areas.\n\nFor commuters, the location offers an attractive balance between the convenience of a well-established town and accessibility to the capital. Dublin Airport is approximately 25km from Ratoath, while the M3 Parkway is also readily accessible"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \nA welcoming entrance hall provides access to all principal rooms and incorporates useful storage, including the hot press.\n\nKitchen / Dining / Sitting Room - \nA well-proportioned open-plan living space forming the heart of the apartment. The generous footprint provides ample room for kitchen, dining and living space, making this an ideal space for both entertaining and everyday living.\n\nMaster Bedroom - \nA substantial double bedroom with excellent floor space and a built-in wardrobe, providing generous storage. The room is further complemented by a private en-suite.\n\nEnsuite - \nA well-appointed private en-suite serving the principal bedroom.\n\nBedroom 2 - \nA second generously sized double bedroom, again offering excellent proportions and a built-in wardrobe.\n\nBathroom - \nA well-proportioned main bathroom serving the apartment.\n\nHot Press - \nConveniently located off the hall and providing useful household storage.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Two-bedroom first-floor apartment </li><li>Approximately 76.8 sq. m. / 827 sq. ft. </li><li>BER Rating: B </li><li>Generously proportioned accommodation throughout </li><li>Impressive open-plan kitchen/dining/sitting room </li><li>Two spacious double bedrooms </li><li>Two built-in wardrobes </li><li>Principal bedroom with private en-suite </li><li>Excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, investors or downsizers </li><li>Convenient Ratoath location with strong transport links to Dublin</ul>"
      },
